{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115078","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115078/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115078/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115078/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115078","id":3825902469,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7kCqOF","number":115078,"title":"[GDScript] Function arguments with type `Callable` cannot be made optional using `null`","user":{"login":"SnaveSutit","id":28514936,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTE0OTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28514936?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnaveSutit","html_url":"https://github.com/SnaveSutit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnaveSutit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnaveSutit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnaveSutit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnaveSutit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnaveSutit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnaveSutit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnaveSutit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnaveSutit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SnaveSutit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-01-17T21:50:05Z","updated_at":"2026-01-17T23:24:47Z","closed_at":"2026-01-17T22:54:30Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Godot Version: `4.6.rc1`\n\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot rc1\n\n### Issue description\n\nI cannot make a function argument typed as `Callable` have a default value of `null`:\n```gdscript\nfunc foo(callback: Callable = null) -> void:\n    pass\n\n// Cannot assign a value of type \"null\" as \"Callable\".\n```\n\nThis can kinda be worked around by setting the default value to a noop lambda function:\n```gdscript\nfunc foo(callback: Callable = func(): pass) -> void:\n    pass\n```\nBut that feels a little goofy, since I can set other complex types to null by default in arguments, e.g. `Vector2`.\n\nNot sure if this is intended or not. 🤷\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a script.\n- Create a function in that script.\n- Add an argument to the function typed as a `Callable`, and set it's default value to `null`.\n- Observe the error in the editor.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[optional-callable-argument.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24692203/optional-callable-argument.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizat